<title>GERMANY: Wuensche 9-mth sales up, profits down.</title>
<headline>Wuensche 9-mth sales up, profits down.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit per month	   2.4	 vs 4.6</p>
<p>    Group sales				993	 vs 926</p>
<p>NOTE - Textile wholesaler Wuensche AG said in a regulatory news release it expected only a slight improvement in fourth quarter sales, and it would be difficult to match 1995 profits for the full business year.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
